  "subject": "Ada Founder invited you to join WalkCo on Cofoundaz",
  "html": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px;color:#1a1a1a\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:20px;color:#051736\">Join WalkCo on Cofoundaz</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;line-height:1.5;color:#333\">Ada Founder invited you to join WalkCo as Mentor.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px\"><a href=\"http://localhost:3000/invite/<invite-token>\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;background:#0F6AFC;color:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600\">Accept invitation</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;color:#555\">Or paste this link into your browser:</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13px;word-break:break-all\"><a href=\"http://localhost:3000/invite/<invite-token>\" style=\"color:#0F6AFC\">http://localhost:3000/invite/<invite-token></a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#888\">This invitation expires in 14 days.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#888\">If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p></div>"
